{"vid":"HPUwW3gosmI","source":"HPUwW3gosmI.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"You should not always pronounce this"},{"t":3.1,"txt":"letter in English. There are so many"},{"t":6.4,"txt":"words with silent t's."},{"t":10.2,"txt":"Today, I'm going to teach you the rules"},{"t":12.5,"txt":"when you should never pronounce the"},{"t":15.2,"txt":"letter t in English even when it's"},{"t":17.8,"txt":"written. Now, in modern RP, my accent,"},{"t":21.7,"txt":"when you do pronounce the letter t, it"},{"t":24.4,"txt":"should sound beautifully clear. If you"},{"t":26.9,"txt":"want to sound unmistakably British, then"},{"t":30.2,"txt":"you might be interested in my 5-day"},{"t":33.4,"txt":"British Accent Bootcamp. We cover t"},{"t":37,"txt":"pronunciation on day two. This Bootcamp"},{"t":39.6,"txt":"is 5 days of focused pronunciation"},{"t":42.6,"txt":"lessons on the sounds that define a"},{"t":45.2,"txt":"British accent. From the crisp t sound"},{"t":48.9,"txt":"and the soft r sound to vowel clarity"},{"t":53.3,"txt":"and natural rhythm. Thousands of my"},{"t":56,"txt":"students have already participated in"},{"t":58,"txt":"the Bootcamp and they say that they"},{"t":59.8,"txt":"start sounding more confident and more"},{"t":62.5,"txt":"authentically British from the very"},{"t":64.5,"txt":"first lesson. Right now, I am offering"},{"t":67.4,"txt":"two things. One is a huge discount and"},{"t":72.3,"txt":"two is lifetime access to the course"},{"t":75.8,"txt":"materials."},{"t":77.4,"txt":"So, join the Bootcamp and start sounding"},{"t":80.6,"txt":"more natural and more British. Just"},{"t":83.5,"txt":"click the link in the description box or"},{"t":86,"txt":"scan the QR code there. Let's begin with"},{"t":88.9,"txt":"the lesson."},{"t":90.3,"txt":"Our first section is very short. Silent"},{"t":93.5,"txt":"t's at the beginning of words. There are"},{"t":96.3,"txt":"very few words that start with silent"},{"t":99.1,"txt":"t's. We have two here. Technically, we"},{"t":102.8,"txt":"don't have any words that genuinely"},{"t":105.5,"txt":"start with a silent t. However, many"},{"t":108.9,"txt":"English speakers find it difficult to"},{"t":111.7,"txt":"pronounce the consonant sounds t"},{"t":114.2,"txt":"and s"},{"t":115.4,"txt":"together."},{"t":116.7,"txt":"ps"},{"t":117.8,"txt":"ts"},{"t":118.6,"txt":">> [laughter]"},{"t":119.6,"txt":">> See you. I'm struggling. That means that"},{"t":121.8,"txt":"even though the words tsar and tsunami"},{"t":126.1,"txt":"should start with a t sound,"},{"t":129.4,"txt":"most speakers don't bother with it and"},{"t":131.8,"txt":"just say zar and tsunami instead. Choose"},{"t":137.3,"txt":"whichever is most comfortable for you."},{"t":139.6,"txt":"It doesn't really matter and I wouldn't"},{"t":141,"txt":"say they are everyday words for most"},{"t":143.2,"txt":"people. Next, we have our longest"},{"t":145.4,"txt":"category of silent t words. Words ending"},{"t":148.8,"txt":"in the letters s t l e like castle and"},{"t":154.6,"txt":"whistle."},{"t":156.2,"txt":"They end with sul."},{"t":158.9,"txt":"Now, some speakers will go directly from"},{"t":161.7,"txt":"the s to the l"},{"t":163.9,"txt":"like sul."},{"t":165.7,"txt":"Sul. Others, myself included, will"},{"t":169,"txt":"insert a soft schwa sound. Sul."},{"t":173.2,"txt":"Sul. You might find that version easier"},{"t":175.8,"txt":"to pronounce."},{"t":177.4,"txt":"Castle. Whistle."},{"t":180.4,"txt":"And can you think of any more words that"},{"t":182.3,"txt":"end in these letters?"},{"t":184.1,"txt":"Well, we've got quite a few that rhyme"},{"t":186,"txt":"with whistle."},{"t":187.5,"txt":"Bristle, gristle, and thistle."},{"t":191.6,"txt":"Bristles are short, stiff hairs in a"},{"t":195.4,"txt":"brush."},{"t":196.6,"txt":"And gristle is that white chewy bit you"},{"t":200.4,"txt":"sometimes get in meat. The thistle is"},{"t":203.2,"txt":"the national emblem of Scotland."},{"t":206.4,"txt":"And in fact, a thistle has sharp"},{"t":209.6,"txt":"bristles. That's a nice way to remember"},{"t":212.6,"txt":"the pronunciation and the meaning of"},{"t":214.5,"txt":"those words. We also have another plant,"},{"t":217.2,"txt":"mistletoe. And I know technically it"},{"t":219.6,"txt":"doesn't end in s t l e, but the letters"},{"t":222.8,"txt":"are in there and the first t is silent."},{"t":225.2,"txt":"It's mistletoe, not mistletoe. This is a"},{"t":229.2,"txt":"plant often used as a Christmas"},{"t":231.6,"txt":"decoration. It has green leaves and"},{"t":234.3,"txt":"shiny white berries. We tend to hang it"},{"t":237.9,"txt":"from the ceiling."},{"t":239.6,"txt":"And maybe you've heard of the tradition"},{"t":241.7,"txt":"that you should kiss under it. I"},{"t":244.5,"txt":"pronounce this word with an unvoiced s"},{"t":247.6,"txt":"sound, mistletoe, but some people use a"},{"t":251.5,"txt":"voiced z"},{"t":253.1,"txt":"sound, mizzletow. Then we have apostle"},{"t":257.5,"txt":"with a short o vowel sound. With a short"},{"t":262.2,"txt":"e sound, we have wrestle, pestle, and"},{"t":266.2,"txt":"nestle."},{"t":268,"txt":"Take care with the silent w at the"},{"t":270.5,"txt":"beginning of wrestle."},{"t":273,"txt":"And finally, hustle and bustle,"},{"t":275.8,"txt":"and rustle. I love saying those words."},{"t":278.9,"txt":"Hustle, bustle, rustle."},{"t":281.2,"txt":"Okay, let's practice. Shadow me now to"},{"t":283.9,"txt":"practice those silent t words. Speak"},{"t":287.3,"txt":"along with me or use the pause button"},{"t":290.2,"txt":"and repeat after me. As the hustle and"},{"t":293,"txt":"bustle slowly subsided,"},{"t":296,"txt":"I began to hear the rustling sound of a"},{"t":299,"txt":"mouse nestling in its burrow."},{"t":304.7,"txt":"The wind whistled round the castle as"},{"t":308.3,"txt":"the apostle wrestled to close the heavy"},{"t":311.6,"txt":"door."},{"t":315.3,"txt":"Okay, let's move on now to words ending"},{"t":318.7,"txt":"in the letters s t e n."},{"t":323,"txt":"The letter t is usually silent in words"},{"t":326.6,"txt":"like fasten"},{"t":328.8,"txt":"and listen."},{"t":331.3,"txt":"It isn't fasten or listen. Drop the t"},{"t":335.6,"txt":"sound. Fasten."},{"t":338,"txt":"Listen."},{"t":339.4,"txt":"See how much smoother that feels? It's"},{"t":341.6,"txt":"easier to say without the t sound. We've"},{"t":344.4,"txt":"also got glisten and christen that rhyme"},{"t":349.7,"txt":"with listen. And then we have hasten,"},{"t":353.9,"txt":"chasten,"},{"t":355.4,"txt":"and moisten. Be careful though, not all"},{"t":359.1,"txt":"s t e n words follow this silent t rule."},{"t":363.3,"txt":"The author of Sense and Sensibility and"},{"t":365.8,"txt":"Pride and Prejudice, for example, is"},{"t":367.7,"txt":"Jane Austen, not Jane Austen."},{"t":371.1,"txt":"Now, [snorts] let's practice those"},{"t":372.5,"txt":"silent t words. Shadow me if you can or"},{"t":376,"txt":"listen, pause, and repeat. We hastened"},{"t":379.1,"txt":"to church to watch and listen as the"},{"t":382.4,"txt":"baby was christened in a glistening"},{"t":385.4,"txt":"gown."},{"t":389.4,"txt":"Okay, next up we have got soften and"},{"t":394,"txt":"often. Should you ever pronounce the t"},{"t":397.2,"txt":"in these words? Okay, in soften we never"},{"t":400.6,"txt":"pronounce the t,"},{"t":402.2,"txt":"but you can pronounce the t in often."},{"t":406.1,"txt":"Often. Many people are taught that you"},{"t":408.6,"txt":"should never say often. It's not true."},{"t":411.7,"txt":"Lots of people say it. Often or often"},{"t":414.8,"txt":"are both totally fine. I tend to say"},{"t":417.5,"txt":"often. It's definitely safe to say that"},{"t":420.6,"txt":"the t in soften is always silent. Soft,"},{"t":424.9,"txt":"soften. We also have some silent t's"},{"t":428,"txt":"that pop up in the middle of words like"},{"t":431.2,"txt":"Christmas,"},{"t":433.2,"txt":"mortgage,"},{"t":435,"txt":"and chestnut."},{"t":437.2,"txt":"Some people might pronounce a soft"},{"t":440.7,"txt":"t in chestnut,"},{"t":442.8,"txt":"but it's not very common. It's not"},{"t":445.1,"txt":"wrong, but it's not common. And the"},{"t":447.7,"txt":"letters t h in asthma are silent, too."},{"t":453.4,"txt":"So, it's asthma, not asthma or"},{"t":456.7,"txt":"asthma, although some people do"},{"t":458.9,"txt":"occasionally say this. I think that's"},{"t":460.6,"txt":"very hard to say. As, asthma."},{"t":464.4,"txt":"Asthma."},{"t":466.1,"txt":"Asthma is so much easier. For me, it's"},{"t":468.4,"txt":"asthma,"},{"t":469.7,"txt":"but I have heard North Americans use the"},{"t":472.6,"txt":"voiced z sound. Asthma. Now, I know this"},{"t":476.9,"txt":"lesson is all about when we never"},{"t":478.9,"txt":"pronounce the t in certain words, but I"},{"t":481.9,"txt":"have to let you know about this next"},{"t":484.5,"txt":"secret because it will make your"},{"t":486.8,"txt":"pronunciation sound so much more"},{"t":489.6,"txt":"natural. So, we don't have to drop the t"},{"t":493.2,"txt":"sound in these words, but we frequently"},{"t":496.8,"txt":"do."},{"t":497.9,"txt":"Listen and repeat to compare."},{"t":501.4,"txt":"Post-war,"},{"t":503.4,"txt":"post-war. Lastly,"},{"t":506.7,"txt":"lastly. Wristband,"},{"t":510.3,"txt":"wristband. Now, did you notice that I"},{"t":512.8,"txt":"dropped the t sound the second time I"},{"t":515.7,"txt":"said the word? Now, this often happens"},{"t":518,"txt":"when we have a fricative like s"},{"t":521.2,"txt":"a t and then another consonant sound."},{"t":524.6,"txt":"Fricative consonants are s z f"},{"t":530.6,"txt":"v"},{"t":532,"txt":"th"},{"t":534.8,"txt":"sh zh and h. A silent t in these words"},{"t":541.2,"txt":"just makes them easier to say. The t"},{"t":544.1,"txt":"sound can also disappear like this"},{"t":546.3,"txt":"between words, too. For example, she has"},{"t":550.4,"txt":"the nicest smile. He's got two left"},{"t":554.3,"txt":"feet."},{"t":555.9,"txt":"We got the last bus home."},{"t":559.6,"txt":"Nicest smile. Left feet. Last bus."},{"t":565.6,"txt":"Okay, let's try dropping some t's."},{"t":568.4,"txt":"Shadow me if you can or listen, pause,"},{"t":571.3,"txt":"and repeat. The bank softened the blow"},{"t":575,"txt":"and reduced my mortgage payments last"},{"t":578.6,"txt":"Christmas."},{"t":582.6,"txt":"Now, remember, it is not obligatory to"},{"t":585.7,"txt":"drop the t sound from reduced or last"},{"t":590.7,"txt":"here, but it's very common in connected"},{"t":593.7,"txt":"speech. If it feels forced, don't do it."},{"t":597.4,"txt":"Only do it if it makes you feel that"},{"t":599.8,"txt":"your speech flows more. Okay, we will"},{"t":602.6,"txt":"finish with several words that we have"},{"t":605.2,"txt":"borrowed from French that all end in a"},{"t":608.4,"txt":"silent t. Words like ballet, gourmet,"},{"t":613.4,"txt":"crochet,"},{"t":615.4,"txt":"chalet, and buffet or buffet. We also"},{"t":620.4,"txt":"have valet, but some people do pronounce"},{"t":624.1,"txt":"it valet."},{"t":626.2,"txt":"Then we have depot and rapport. Let's"},{"t":631,"txt":"practice those silent t's at the end of"},{"t":633.5,"txt":"words. Shadow me or listen, pause, and"},{"t":636.6,"txt":"repeat after me."},{"t":638.6,"txt":"After the ballet, we went to a gourmet"},{"t":642.1,"txt":"buffet in a Swiss-style chalet."},{"t":648.7,"txt":"Okay, remember, if you'd like to take"},{"t":651.2,"txt":"your pronunciation even further and"},{"t":654.2,"txt":"master some of the essential modern RP"},{"t":657.2,"txt":"sounds, that's my accent by the way,"},{"t":660,"txt":"come and join my 5-day British accent"},{"t":663,"txt":"boot camp. It's a really focused way to"},{"t":666.2,"txt":"sound more natural and speak more"},{"t":668.3,"txt":"confidently in just 5 days. As I told"},{"t":671.5,"txt":"you, we are offering a huge discount and"},{"t":674.4,"txt":"lifetime access. Don't miss out. Click"},{"t":678,"txt":"the link in the description or scan the"},{"t":680.3,"txt":"QR code on screen to learn more and"},{"t":682.8,"txt":"join. I would love to know which of"},{"t":685.1,"txt":"these silent t words you were"},{"t":687.4,"txt":"pronouncing incorrectly. Are there any"},{"t":690,"txt":"silent t words that we haven't mentioned"},{"t":692.1,"txt":"in the lesson,"},{"t":693.4,"txt":"let me know in the comments, and I'll"},{"t":695,"txt":"see you in the next video. Bye."},{"t":706.1,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":715.3,"txt":"[music]"}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"You"},{"t":0.24,"w":"should"},{"t":0.56,"w":"not"},{"t":1.2,"w":"always"},{"t":1.96,"w":"pronounce"},{"t":2.8,"w":"this"},{"t":3.12,"w":"letter"},{"t":4,"w":"in"},{"t":4.16,"w":"English."},{"t":5,"w":"There"},{"t":5.28,"w":"are"},{"t":5.44,"w":"so"},{"t":5.96,"w":"many"},{"t":6.4,"w":"words"},{"t":7.48,"w":"with"},{"t":7.8,"w":"silent"},{"t":8.72,"w":"t's."},{"t":10.2,"w":"Today,"},{"t":10.72,"w":"I'm"},{"t":10.88,"w":"going"},{"t":11.08,"w":"to"},{"t":11.16,"w":"teach"},{"t":11.44,"w":"you"},{"t":11.56,"w":"the"},{"t":11.68,"w":"rules"},{"t":12.52,"w":"when"},{"t":12.84,"w":"you"},{"t":13,"w":"should"},{"t":13.52,"w":"never"},{"t":14.28,"w":"pronounce"},{"t":15.08,"w":"the"},{"t":15.2,"w":"letter"},{"t":15.44,"w":"t"},{"t":15.88,"w":"in"},{"t":16.04,"w":"English"},{"t":16.76,"w":"even"},{"t":17.36,"w":"when"},{"t":17.52,"w":"it's"},{"t":17.76,"w":"written."},{"t":18.48,"w":"Now,"},{"t":18.96,"w":"in"},{"t":19.24,"w":"modern"},{"t":19.56,"w":"RP,"},{"t":20.36,"w":"my"},{"t":20.64,"w":"accent,"},{"t":21.68,"w":"when"},{"t":21.92,"w":"you"},{"t":22.16,"w":"do"},{"t":22.52,"w":"pronounce"},{"t":23.08,"w":"the"},{"t":23.16,"w":"letter"},{"t":23.44,"w":"t,"},{"t":24.24,"w":"it"},{"t":24.44,"w":"should"},{"t":24.72,"w":"sound"},{"t":25.28,"w":"beautifully"},{"t":26,"w":"clear."},{"t":26.64,"w":"If"},{"t":26.8,"w":"you"},{"t":26.92,"w":"want"},{"t":27.16,"w":"to"},{"t":27.24,"w":"sound"},{"t":27.84,"w":"unmistakably"},{"t":29,"w":"British,"},{"t":30.12,"w":"then"},{"t":30.24,"w":"you"},{"t":30.4,"w":"might"},{"t":30.64,"w":"be"},{"t":30.76,"w":"interested"},{"t":31.56,"w":"in"},{"t":31.8,"w":"m